WEBVTT

1
00:00:04,430 --> 00:00:07,500
Husband, I have been waiting for you for a long time

2
00:00:09,560 --> 00:00:12,060
Since my sister-in-law said that taking off her red hijab would keep me safe

3
00:00:12,760 --> 00:00:15,060
The bride's red hijab must be lifted by the groom

4
00:00:15,060 --> 00:00:17,060
So I can only play the groom

5
00:00:17,060 --> 00:00:22,080
Madam, let me help you open the red hijab with the sword.

6
00:00:22,080 --> 00:00:23,380
you are not my husband

7
00:00:23,380 --> 00:00:25,080
Why do you want to open my red hijab with a sword?

8
00:00:30,590 --> 00:00:31,590
follow sister wife

9
00:00:31,590 --> 00:00:33,590
As long as you lift off the red hijab, you'll be fine

10
00:00:34,660 --> 00:00:36,160
Want to see me so much

11
00:00:38,450 --> 00:00:39,950
Then let me show you first

12
00:00:39,950 --> 00:00:49,050
You have to lift the red hijab yourself to pass the level

13
00:00:49,050 --> 00:00:50,550
The red hijab was lifted by her

14
00:00:50,550 --> 00:00:52,550
Then I will definitely die

15
00:00:52,550 --> 00:01:04,950
Husband, are you wearing a red hijab?
